Right, the square brackets aren't prescriptive, but I think that some
prescriptions should be made with regards to *what* exactly the
chemistry-related gismu *mean*. As it stands, {kijno} could arguably be
used to refer to anything containing at least some oxygen. I don't know
about you, but I wouldn't like water to be called {kijno} :P

.i mi'e la tsani mu'o

